# Keeps `gcloud builds submit` from uploading history, Terraform state and local
# caches to Cloud Build. Without it gcloud generates one from .gitignore, which
# is close but writes itself into the checkout as an untracked file.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
**/tfplan
.env
coverage.out
